      "id": "776b49d3-2f12-4088-81e7-ea6f50ce6531",
      "name": "Email Payment Link",
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<p>Hi {{ $json.firstName }},</p><p>Great talking with you. Here is the link to lock in the <b>{{ $json.category }}</b> spot on the Porchlight Card, Irving 75063 Edition:</p><p><a href=\"https://buy.stripe.com/00wfZidVXgrF8Qw8tq6sw00\">https://buy.stripe.com/00wfZidVXgrF8Qw8tq6sw00</a></p><p>It is $300 one time. That covers design, printing, and mailing to about 2,500 homes. You will be the only {{ $json.category }} on the card.</p><p>Spots go first come, first served, so the category is yours as soon as payment goes through. After that we will send a short form for your logo and offer.</p><p>Questions? Call or text 908-477-9409.</p><p>Abdullah<br>Kynetic Marketing</p>",
        "operation": "send",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "senderName": "Kynetic Marketing"
        },
        "resource": "message",
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.email }}",
